      "lines": [
        "1056. 一天之内售出运进全部土豆的75%，午前售出的土",
        "豆为午后售出的$5/7$. 如果运进的土豆是$3\\frac{1}{5}$吨，那么",
        "午前和午后售出的土豆各为多少吨？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1057",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1057. 在数学测验课上，有8名学生得“5分”，18名学生得",
        "“4分”，12名学生得“3分”，还有几个学生得“2分”.",
        "如果测验的平均分数是3.8分，那么有多少学生得了",
        "“2分”？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1058",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1058. 解方程：",
        "1) $\\frac{2}{3}x+\\frac{1}{2}x-\\frac{3}{4}=2-\\frac{1}{3}x+2\\frac{1}{4}x$；",
        "2) $1-1\\frac{1}{2}a+3\\frac{2}{5}a=1\\frac{1}{3}a-2\\frac{7}{15}a+2\\frac{1}{2}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1059",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1059. 计算：",
        "1) $1\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot\\left(8\\frac{2}{3}:1\\frac{4}{9}-3\\frac{3}{8}+1\\frac{5}{8}\\right)-1\\frac{5}{6}$；",
        "2) $\\left(3\\frac{1}{15}-1\\frac{1}{15}:1\\frac{3}{5}+\\frac{2}{5}\\right)\\cdot2\\frac{1}{7}-1\\frac{1}{7}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "家庭作业题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1060",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1060. 作乘法：",
        "1) $7\\frac{2}{13}\\cdot2$；　　2) $8\\frac{3}{28}\\cdot5$；　　3) $6\\frac{3}{8}\\cdot2$；",
        "4) $5\\frac{7}{16}\\cdot8$；　　5) $5\\cdot3\\frac{1}{5}$；　　6) $9\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot9$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1061",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1061. 求下列各式的值：",
        "1) $\\left(3\\frac{3}{5}-2\\frac{1}{15}\\right)\\cdot5$；　　2) $\\left(1\\frac{14}{17}-1\\frac{1}{34}\\right)\\cdot34$；"
      ]
    },
